<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/module-builder.css">
<section class="page-title"><p class="eyebrow">Core Administration</p><h1>Review New Development App</h1></section>
<section class="panel">
  <h2><%= input.name %></h2>
  <p><%= input.description %></p>
  <dl>
    <dt>App key</dt><dd><%= input.slug %></dd>
    <dt>Private GitHub repository</dt><dd><%= configuration.githubOwner %>/<%= input.slug %> (new repository only)</dd>
    <dt>Framework</dt><dd>Node/Express, WHS branding, Global Control sign-in and existing per-app roles; app-specific features remain to be developed.</dd>
    <dt>Render region</dt><dd>Oregon, for both new resources</dd>
    <dt>Web Service</dt><dd><%= input.slug %>-development &mdash; 0.5c-512mb, lowest paid tier, one instance (published estimate USD 7/month)</dd>
    <dt>Separate PostgreSQL database</dt><dd><%= input.slug %>-development-db &mdash; 0.1c-256mb, lowest paid tier (published compute estimate USD 6/month)</dd>
    <dt>Initial access</dt><dd>Active Global ADMINs<% if (testers.length) { %>, plus these named testers as Teacher:
      <ul><% testers.forEach(tester => { %><li><%= tester.display_name %> (<%= tester.email %>)</li><% }) %></ul><% } else { %> only<% } %></dd>
  </dl>
  <p class="mb-warning"><strong>Billable resources: estimated compute USD 13/month minimum.</strong>
    Database storage, workspace/account subscriptions, usage, tax, proration and currency changes are additional or unknown.
    GitHub subscription is account-level, not a new subscription for each app. No higher tiers, high availability or automatic disk upgrades are requested.
    See <a href="/admin/infrastructure-costs">GitHub &amp; Render Costs</a> for current estimates and indicative NZD conversion.</p>
  <p>Setup records each step and waits for database/deployment readiness. Keep the progress page open while it runs.
    Closing it pauses further steps; use Resume to continue. Resources already created remain billable.
    Nothing is automatically deleted, integrated into Core or released to production.</p>
  <form action="/module-builder/new/create" method="post" class="mb-form">
    <input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
    <input type="hidden" name="approval" value="<%= approval %>">
    <label class="mb-wide"><span><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required> I approve these new paid resources and the listed access.</span></label>
    <label>Type <strong><%= input.slug %></strong> to confirm<input name="confirm" required autocomplete="off"></label>
    <div class="mb-actions mb-wide"><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Approve and register development app</button><a class="button" href="/module-builder/new">Change details</a></div>
  </form>
</section>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
